			"Message": "build(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates with documentation fixes\n\nSynchronize Element submodule from 6b50bc7 to ec42cbd0 bringing coordinated changes across 5 components:\n- Mountain: Initialize PostHog telemetry at boot before CLI parsing for early crash context. Fix #[tauri::command] attribute on internal dispatcher. Restore recently opened folder via BuildInitialUrl to skip Welcome → Open Folder round-trip. Fix macOS window dragging with TitleBarStyle::Overlay + hidden_title(true).\n- Sky: Eliminate early paint flash with inline CSS matching VS Code Dark+. Add client-side PostHog throttling (10s window, 2×/sec limit). Fix lifecycle phase signaling by moving phase 3→4 advancement to separate <script> and correcting Tauri invoke signature.\n- Wind: Route colon-prefixed IPC methods through MountainIPCInvoke for consistency. Fix em dashes to hyphens in LifecycleService and PostHog comments.\n- Output: Route colon-prefixed Tauri commands in polyfills through MountainIPCInvoke.\n- Cocoon: Submodule updated to a5ec2e6d.\n\nAlso normalize en-dashes to hyphens in Maintain/Script/PostHogCapture.sh comments and README.md tables for Keep a Changelog consistency.\n\nThis coordinated update delivers recently opened folder restoration, macOS window drag fixes, IPC routing consistency, and early paint flash elimination while maintaining identical runtime behavior.",
			"SHA": "9936322000d5ea80c86ba6f01b8d1ed3eba48a88"
		},
